1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,680
 Dear young women, I testify that you are beloved daughters of heavenly parents with a divine

2
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:13,440
 nature and an eternal destiny.

3
00:00:13,440 --> 00:00:19,760
 Each of you has a crucial and important work to do here on earth.

4
00:00:19,760 --> 00:00:26,080
 That work is different for each person, but if you choose to love God and Jesus Christ

5
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:33,120
 and to trust them, doing that work will bring you the same great joy.

6
00:00:33,120 --> 00:00:35,920
 I would like to share seven ways that will help you.

